# Pin canonical-artifact line endings to LF so byte-identity is reproducible on
# every platform and checkout (overrides a machine-level core.autocrlf=true).
#
# The G1-G4 trust contract and the G4 package depend on byte-identical
# canonical documents: fixtures, schemas, skill sources, and the plugin package
# are compared byte-for-byte by the drift/identity tests and the deterministic
# build. A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true converts these to CRLF,
# which the canonical validators reject ("CR is not canonical") and which breaks
# the byte-identity gates. These rules force LF for exactly those artifacts.
*.json           text eol=lf
schemas/**       text eol=lf
fixtures/**      text eol=lf
skills/**        text eol=lf
agent-plugins/** text eol=lf
